ndance or dust-cover claim.</p><p class="supporting">Daytime IR mixes albedo and thermophysical properties; brightness contrasts are not by themselves a compositional or hazard classification.</p><p class="supporting">~100 m source resolution, upsampled above z9; display-grade only.</p></details></div></section><section aria-label="Basemaps"><h3>Basemaps</h3><p class="supporting">Optical context and mission imagery.</p><p class="supporting">No dataset available.</p></section><section aria-label="Map overlays"><h3>Map overlays</h3><p class="supporting">Recorded traverses and dataset coverage outlines; these do not establish waypoint eligibility.</p><p class="supporting">No dataset available.</p></section><h3>Interface preview</h3><p class="supporting">Demonstration controls below affect schematic artwork only.</p><label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox"/>Show schematic preview <span class="badge science">Scenario</span></label><button class="full">View scientific data register</button>'
